; LOC-08 (M3-105). The approved M3-4A EN_Garage (12 x 9 m: the pressurised ready room on its plinth, the vacuum
; rover bay with the EVA porch, VH_Rover docked at the tunnel) is the room shell: resources/campaign/rooms/LOC-08.json
; names it ("shell": "garage") and authors everything else. HabitatKitPreload and GaragePreload make the kit, garage
; and rover GLBs dependencies of this scene, so a threaded room load decodes them off the main thread.
[node name="GarageRoom" type="Node3D"]
script = ExtResource("1_room")
room_id = "LOC-08"

